msgctxt "wish"
msgid ""
"Happy birthday to you! Wishing you a wonderful, amazing life, an ocean of love, "
"endless happy times, good health and a great mood!"
msgstr ""
"Happy birthday to you! Wishing you a wonderful, amazing life, an ocean of love, "
"endless happy times, good health and a great mood!"

msgctxt "wish"
msgid "Happy birthday!"
msgstr "Happy birthday!"

msgctxt "wish"
msgid ""
"Happy birthday! An ocean of happiness and smiles, and inspiration to achieve your "
"goals. May life's colours and surprises delight you. Enjoy every day and share those "
"feelings with others. Stay yourself: you are one of the best people on the planet!"
msgstr ""
"Happy birthday! An ocean of happiness and smiles, and inspiration to achieve your "
"goals. May life's colours and surprises delight you. Enjoy every day and share those "
"feelings with others. Stay yourself: you are one of the best people on the planet!"

msgctxt "wish"
msgid ""
"Happy birthday! May you always live in joy, surrounded by peace and lasting "
"happiness. Wishing you a little of everything, and may even ordinary days sometimes "
"fill with magical events."
msgstr ""
"Happy birthday! May you always live in joy, surrounded by peace and lasting "
"happiness. Wishing you a little of everything, and may even ordinary days sometimes "
"fill with magical events."

msgctxt "wish"
msgid ""
"Happy birthday! May your wildest wishes come true, with bright, unforgettable "
"experiences and success in everything you start. May your days be sunny and bright, "
"filled with smiles and happiness. Positivity in everything!"
msgstr ""
"Happy birthday! May your wildest wishes come true, with bright, unforgettable "
"experiences and success in everything you start. May your days be sunny and bright, "
"filled with smiles and happiness. Positivity in everything!"

msgctxt "wish"
msgid ""
"Happy birthday! Wishing you a positive mood and plenty of joyful days. May you greet "
"every morning with a smile and hope for the best. May your dreams have wings, and "
"your plans come true!"
msgstr ""
"Happy birthday! Wishing you a positive mood and plenty of joyful days. May you greet "
"every morning with a smile and hope for the best. May your dreams have wings, and "
"your plans come true!"

msgctxt "wish"
msgid ""
"Happy birthday! Wishing you a wonderful day surrounded by the people who love and "
"appreciate you most, and lots of fun. Smile, enjoy being together, and may happiness "
"fill your life."
msgstr ""
"Happy birthday! Wishing you a wonderful day surrounded by the people who love and "
"appreciate you most, and lots of fun. Smile, enjoy being together, and may happiness "
"fill your life."

msgctxt "wish"
msgid ""
"Happy birthday! Wishing you more inspiration and energy this year. May everything you"
" take on end in success. And plenty of good health, because with it you can do "
"anything!"
msgstr ""
"Happy birthday! Wishing you more inspiration and energy this year. May everything you"
" take on end in success. And plenty of good health, because with it you can do "
"anything!"

